Chapter: SpirvProbe

 A probe for the SPIR-V plug. It mixes integer and float arithmetic, a
 let-binding, a conditional and a call, because those are the four places
 the emitter used to produce something SPIR-V would refuse.

Section: Probe

  spv-helper : Real -> Real
  spv-helper (x) = x * 3.0

  gpu-axpy : Integer, Real, Real -> Real
  gpu-axpy (i) (a) (x) =
    let scaled = a * x
    in let shifted = scaled + 1.5
    in let helped = spv-helper shifted
    in if i > 0 then helped else 0.0
